WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:05.505
Emmy's friend Kate was sleeping over.

2
00:00:05.506 --> 00:00:12.566
The girls were watching a funny movie.

3
00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:17.875
Harry came into the room.

4
00:00:17.876 --> 00:00:22.473
"Why are you laughing so hard?" he asked.

5
00:00:22.474 --> 00:00:26.874
"We're watching a movie," Emmy said.

6
00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:30.084
"Go away!"

7
00:00:30.085 --> 00:00:34.126
Harry sighed and went away.

8
00:00:34.127 --> 00:00:38.992
Emmy and Kate started laughing again.

9
00:00:38.994 --> 00:00:46.008
Harry and Oliver ran into the room and sat down.

10
00:00:46.009 --> 00:00:52.749
"We want to watch too!" Oliver said.

11
00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:56.192
"Mom!" Emmy called.

12
00:00:56.193 --> 00:01:01.235
"Harry and Oliver are bothering us."

13
00:01:01.236 --> 00:01:05.681
Mom shooed the boys away.

14
00:01:05.682 --> 00:01:13.784
After the movie the girls went upstairs to Emmy's room.

15
00:01:13.785 --> 00:01:19.421
"I can hear them laughing," Oliver said to Harry.

16
00:01:19.422 --> 00:01:23.943
"Do you think they're telling jokes?"

17
00:01:23.944 --> 00:01:29.509
"Maybe they're reading funny stories," Harry said.

18
00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:36.879
"There's only one way to find out."

19
00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:41.101
Oliver and Harry tried to sneak upstairs.

20
00:01:41.102 --> 00:01:44.076
But Mom caught them on the stairs.

21
00:01:44.077 --> 00:01:51.216
"Leave the girls alone."

22
00:01:51.217 --> 00:01:56.572
Downstairs the boys could still hear laughter.

23
00:01:56.573 --> 00:01:59.041
They looked at each other.

24
00:01:59.042 --> 00:02:04.624
"Let's go," Harry whispered.

25
00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:07.659
They tiptoed upstairs.

26
00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.268
Suddenly Emmy threw open her door.

27
00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:13.094
Oliver gasped.

28
00:02:13.095 --> 00:02:18.334
Harry blinked. "What did you do to your hair?"

29
00:02:18.335 --> 00:02:25.973
Emmy grinned. "Come in!"

30
00:02:25.974 --> 00:02:32.558
Kate twirled a brush. "We'll style your hair too!"

31
00:02:32.559 --> 00:02:37.116
"No thanks!" Harry and Oliver said.

32
00:02:37.117 --> 00:02:43.207
The boys ran downstairs as fast as they could.

33
00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:50.992
Emmy and Kate couldn't stop laughing.

